The Mercedes-Benz Vito 108 CDI was part of the W638 (1996-2003) and potentially early W639 (2003-2014) generations, but is not the most recent engine offered in the current W447 Vito. I will evaluate the Vito 108 CDI based on the W639 generation, as it is more recent than the W638. The 108 CDI in the W639 typically had around 88 PS (87 hp) and 200-240 Nm of torque from a 2.1L 4-cylinder diesel engine.

